cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the version-specific Zenodo record
  once the release DOI is available.
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'FrictionEmulatorTrain: a neural-network emulator of Weertman basal friction'
abstract: >-
  PyTorch tools for training and evaluating a neural-network emulator that
  predicts the Weertman basal friction coefficient from a squared friction
  parameter and velocity magnitude. Includes preprocessing, model export,
  accuracy reports, training samples, and a Python inference helper.
